WEBVTT
Language: en

NOTE
Voiced by Tello (Kokoro af_heart). V4 narration — free-home story, Nov 2026.

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.690
Your first inspection, without guessing.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:07.350
Title22 keeps staff records, training and clearances current.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:11.180
And it shows what DSS will ask for, before they do.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:15.110
Nobody hands a new administrator the list.

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.500
The records DSS checks live in binders and printouts.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:23.930
Until a page goes missing, or a clearance lapses and nobody noticed.

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:29.150
Staff files, the 40-hour training, TB and LiveScan dates, incident reports.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.980
Title22 tells you in ten seconds, not ten paragraphs.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.350
Every alert names a person and a date.

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:39.950
Tick an item, and your readiness score climbs.

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:43.080
These are invented staff, from the practice home.

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:45.600
Setup is an evening.

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:48.210
Add your staff. Enter each date once.

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:52.290
Then it warns you before DSS does — with the person's name on it.

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:57.060
Every module maps to something an analyst checks.

00:00:57.180 --> 00:01:01.400
Staff files, training hours, clearance alerts, and the DSS checklist.

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:08.690
A staff document vault — no resident records — and LIC 624 incident reports.

00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:11.080
The core app holds staff records only.

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:15.900
No resident health information lives in it.

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:21.030
Medication records live in a separate corner of their own, under a signed BAA.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:27.410
Tello, the AI assistant, gives you a plain-language briefing.

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:31.910
Overdue tasks, expiring certifications, missing staff documents.

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:35.910
Tello never comments on clinical dosage — on any plan.

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:39.680
Each facility is walled off at the database.

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:44.580
Role-based access, no shared logins, and an append-only audit trail.

00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:48.540
Export or delete your records anytime. We never sell your data.

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:50.890
Built from real facility operations.

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:56.550
Grounded in Title 22, Division 6, Chapter 8.

00:01:56.750 --> 00:02:00.990
A tool, not a certifying body. Staying licensed is still your job.

00:02:04.370 --> 00:02:08.060
Your first home is free — no clock, no card — and it stays free.

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:15.090
$29 a month for one home. $79 for two to five. $139 for six or more.

00:02:15.340 --> 00:02:17.990
Every package includes staff training — and Tello.

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:23.350
Every new account gets 30 days of full access. No card, nothing to cancel.

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:28.940
When it ends, your home stays on the free plan — still usable, and everything you entered stays.

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:30.800
For new RCFE owners.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:34.390
For CE and ICTP trainers, and compliance consultants.

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:37.470
Start with your free home at title22.app.

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:41.150
Just an email. A practice home is ready the moment you're in.
